WEBVTT

00:00:10.530 --> 00:00:11.990
Brother...

00:00:12.740 --> 00:00:15.490
That man is Kuro's...

00:00:33.340 --> 00:00:38.180
"Fierce Battle"

00:00:40.970 --> 00:00:44.890
You should have stayed in the sacred land, Kuro.

00:00:45.390 --> 00:00:48.230
Then Brother, why did you leave the sacred land?

00:00:48.230 --> 00:00:51.360
Why did you go as far as killing Mother and destroying that world?

00:00:52.280 --> 00:00:54.530
I can't forgive you.

00:00:54.530 --> 00:00:56.910
I came here to defeat you!

00:00:57.450 --> 00:00:58.780
That's impossible.

00:00:59.410 --> 00:01:03.870
What can you possibly do, considering the fact that you formed an incomplete contract with a Sub?

00:01:05.410 --> 00:01:07.920
Keita-san is my important contractee!

00:01:08.460 --> 00:01:09.920
Go back, Kuro.

00:01:11.670 --> 00:01:12.670
Keita-san.

00:01:12.960 --> 00:01:13.920
Kuro.

00:01:18.470 --> 00:01:19.800
Synchro!

00:01:27.640 --> 00:01:28.520
Kuro!

00:01:28.520 --> 00:01:29.650
Okay!

00:01:38.410 --> 00:01:41.830
Exceed, Megaexe!

00:01:53.420 --> 00:01:54.800
Why?

00:01:54.800 --> 00:01:56.300
An Exceed?

00:02:00.930 --> 00:02:04.930
My fists are stained with the blood of our kin.

00:02:04.930 --> 00:02:06.520
I won't show any mercy.

00:02:07.480 --> 00:02:08.390
Keita-san.

00:02:08.390 --> 00:02:09.650
Go, Kuro!

00:02:09.650 --> 00:02:10.600
Okay!

00:02:15.150 --> 00:02:19.610
You are still so agile even after using your Exceed...

00:02:19.950 --> 00:02:22.450
Is he controlling the amount of Tera being transferred?

00:02:22.450 --> 00:02:23.740
Right now, Kuro!

00:02:25.080 --> 00:02:26.450
Exceed...!

00:02:27.250 --> 00:02:28.330
Too many openings!

00:02:32.330 --> 00:02:33.590
Kuro!

00:02:36.170 --> 00:02:38.470
Oh? Thousand?

00:02:40.050 --> 00:02:42.930
But you still seem far from being able to control it freely.

00:02:43.850 --> 00:02:45.430
Hit!

00:02:53.360 --> 00:02:54.860
Kuro!

00:02:59.700 --> 00:03:01.110
Keita-kun...

00:03:01.110 --> 00:03:02.410
Kuro-chan...

00:03:08.790 --> 00:03:10.160
Kuro!

00:03:11.790 --> 00:03:13.580
It was all pointless.

00:03:15.460 --> 00:03:18.010
Kuro, are you okay?

00:03:18.960 --> 00:03:21.760
Yes. I can still fight.

00:03:24.510 --> 00:03:27.390
Keita-san, don't tell me you're running out of Tera?!

00:03:27.970 --> 00:03:29.140
Don't worry.

00:03:29.350 --> 00:03:30.640
He's at his limits.

00:03:31.310 --> 00:03:34.400
It's a miracle that a Sub has fought for such a long time..

00:03:34.770 --> 00:03:36.060
Impossible...

00:03:36.570 --> 00:03:37.860
Keita-san!

00:03:37.860 --> 00:03:42.570
I didn't except anyone to be able to freely control his Tera before transferring it to a Mototsumitama.

00:03:43.200 --> 00:03:48.660
But unfortunately, that also increases the amount of Tera that is exhausted.

00:03:50.500 --> 00:03:52.660
Not yet, Kuro...

00:03:52.660 --> 00:03:53.420
Fight on.

00:03:54.040 --> 00:03:55.830
This is impossible.

00:03:56.380 --> 00:03:58.420
Keita-san, you'll die if this goes on!

00:03:58.420 --> 00:04:02.720
Kuro, you came here to defeat him, right?

00:04:03.010 --> 00:04:09.180
Didn't you come to this world... and appear in front of me... because you want to defeat Reishin?

00:04:09.850 --> 00:04:11.100
Keita-san...

00:04:16.440 --> 00:04:20.440
Keita-san's Tera is flowing into me.

00:04:21.780 --> 00:04:25.200
Don't worry about me. Just defeat him!

00:04:25.490 --> 00:04:26.700
But...

00:04:26.700 --> 00:04:28.700
Kuro, do you know?

00:04:28.950 --> 00:04:32.450
The Tera flowing throughout your body is the life of that Sub.

00:04:32.910 --> 00:04:36.460
That incomplete product will die if you continue to fight.

00:04:37.210 --> 00:04:38.590
Go, Kuro.

00:04:38.590 --> 00:04:40.130
Defeat Reishin...

00:04:40.710 --> 00:04:41.960
Keita-san!

00:04:42.210 --> 00:04:43.220
I...

00:04:43.630 --> 00:04:45.510
I-I don't want this!

00:04:46.550 --> 00:04:48.220
Dumbass...

00:04:49.180 --> 00:04:50.720
Keita-san...

00:04:50.720 --> 00:04:52.470
I take back what I say.

00:04:52.810 --> 00:04:55.230
He isn't something incomplete.

00:04:55.230 --> 00:04:57.150
He's a real contractee.

00:04:58.730 --> 00:05:00.110
Can you feel it?

00:05:01.440 --> 00:05:04.240
The surge of Tera overflowing from the Reiseki.

00:05:04.530 --> 00:05:07.200
This place is the same as the scared lands.

00:05:07.200 --> 00:05:09.990
This is the pillar that is maintaining the balance of the Tera in the world.

00:05:10.660 --> 00:05:14.370
It's suitable to be where you will rest in peace.

00:05:21.960 --> 00:05:24.550
Will you rot here, or...

00:05:24.550 --> 00:05:25.880
Reishin-sama!

00:05:32.260 --> 00:05:33.140
Yakumo.

00:05:33.680 --> 00:05:34.890
Yakumo!

00:05:34.890 --> 00:05:36.310
Princess.

00:05:36.310 --> 00:05:38.150
The stars have arrived!

00:05:39.270 --> 00:05:41.770
Hey, we meet again.

00:05:46.030 --> 00:05:50.450
Young contractee, you have matured quite a bit.

00:05:50.450 --> 00:05:53.450
Excel-san! Everyone's here!

00:05:53.450 --> 00:05:55.620
What are you waiting for?

00:05:55.620 --> 00:05:57.710
Leave the rest to Steiner and me.

00:05:57.710 --> 00:05:58.710
All of you, run!

00:05:59.210 --> 00:06:01.460
Wait! Why must we leave, too?

00:06:01.460 --> 00:06:03.920
His life will be in danger if this goes on.

00:06:03.920 --> 00:06:04.710
Hurry!

00:06:04.710 --> 00:06:08.970
I came all the way here... There's no way I'd want to miss the climax!

00:06:09.380 --> 00:06:10.640
But...

00:06:12.220 --> 00:06:13.470
It can't be helped.

00:06:14.260 --> 00:06:15.180
Let's go.

00:06:15.180 --> 00:06:15.970
Princess!

00:06:16.310 --> 00:06:17.480
Okay!

00:06:26.400 --> 00:06:27.740
Well then.

00:06:28.030 --> 00:06:31.410
Things are starting to pile up. Shall we get this started, Reishin?

00:06:36.240 --> 00:06:39.330
We'll reach the designated position soon.

00:06:39.330 --> 00:06:41.580
We'll head to the island once this ship stops.

00:06:41.580 --> 00:06:42.790
It's still early.

00:06:43.460 --> 00:06:47.550
The release of the island's Reiseki and the placing of the surrounding devices...

00:06:47.550 --> 00:06:49.840
Once everything kicks into gear...

00:06:49.840 --> 00:06:51.840
That will be when your work starts.

00:06:53.510 --> 00:06:55.850
But this surge is...

00:06:56.260 --> 00:06:59.890
We didn't factor in the fact that other Mototsumitama might participate in the battle.

00:07:00.390 --> 00:07:01.980
It's within the margin of error.

00:07:01.980 --> 00:07:03.690
The scenario won't change.

00:07:04.400 --> 00:07:06.570
You seem to be looking forward to fighting, Raiga.

00:07:06.570 --> 00:07:08.530
Is that the basic instinct of a Mototsumitama?

00:07:08.820 --> 00:07:12.110
Or is that the burning desire for revenge that is lurking within your soul?

00:07:15.280 --> 00:07:17.160
The moment will arrive soon.

00:07:18.330 --> 00:07:22.620
Shishigami Reishin, don't show me any mercy.

00:07:22.620 --> 00:07:26.550
Against an opponent like you, there's no way I'll show mercy, Steiner.

00:07:41.520 --> 00:07:42.810
Synchro!

00:07:51.570 --> 00:07:52.570
Come.

00:07:52.570 --> 00:07:53.780
Here I come!

00:08:04.370 --> 00:08:05.830
This way!

00:08:05.830 --> 00:08:06.670
Okay!

00:08:26.610 --> 00:08:28.770
You're as powerful as ever.

00:08:28.770 --> 00:08:31.780
Your skills are top-notch, too.

00:08:31.780 --> 00:08:32.490
However!

00:08:34.820 --> 00:08:37.070
You're not the only one who's...

00:08:37.070 --> 00:08:38.070
quick!

00:08:38.950 --> 00:08:40.160
True.

00:08:45.210 --> 00:08:47.500
Didn't expect to miss?

00:08:47.500 --> 00:08:48.710
Your defense is too weak!

00:08:49.710 --> 00:08:51.170
Reishin!

00:08:55.130 --> 00:08:59.720
It's been a while since I met someone who could take advantage of that short instant and counterattack.

00:09:03.430 --> 00:09:05.690
You think that I'm just fast?

00:09:06.900 --> 00:09:09.480
To think that he has enough power to push Steiner back...

00:09:09.860 --> 00:09:11.320
Interesting.

00:09:11.320 --> 00:09:13.860
It's been a while since I got to fight to my heart's content.

00:09:14.110 --> 00:09:15.780
That's great.

00:09:41.220 --> 00:09:42.760
What's up with that tremor?

00:09:42.760 --> 00:09:46.230
A large amount of Tera seems to be clashing against each other inside.

00:09:46.230 --> 00:09:47.020
It's dangerous!

00:09:47.520 --> 00:09:48.900
Let's hurry to the exit.

00:09:48.900 --> 00:09:49.940
Okay!

00:09:55.440 --> 00:09:57.530
Looks like we're surrounded, Yakumo.

00:09:57.530 --> 00:09:58.740
It seems so.

00:09:58.740 --> 00:10:00.280
There are so many enemies...

00:10:00.280 --> 00:10:01.700
Give up!

00:10:01.700 --> 00:10:03.290
You have nowhere to run to!

00:10:03.290 --> 00:10:05.500
We have no intention of running away.

00:10:05.500 --> 00:10:06.160
Yakumo.

00:10:06.160 --> 00:10:07.040
Okay.

00:10:19.840 --> 00:10:21.090
Synchro!

00:10:27.890 --> 00:10:29.480
Go!

00:10:49.500 --> 00:10:52.880
Steiner, you're both going to bite the dust if this keeps up!

00:10:55.090 --> 00:10:57.880
Indeed. Is it a waste of time?

00:11:01.430 --> 00:11:04.010
I'll show you all of my power!

00:11:04.350 --> 00:11:05.890
Let's go, Excel!

00:11:05.890 --> 00:11:06.510
Yes.

00:11:06.890 --> 00:11:09.520
Exceed, Stampede!

00:11:17.030 --> 00:11:17.940
Clones?

00:11:17.940 --> 00:11:22.660
Will you be able to dodge my attacks, now that there are five of me?

00:11:35.670 --> 00:11:36.880
You're lacking!

00:11:54.060 --> 00:11:55.440
Is he defeated?

00:11:55.860 --> 00:11:57.400
The victor is clear.

00:11:58.020 --> 00:12:05.280
Shishigami Reishin, you are pretty much the strongest among the Mototsumitama.

00:12:05.280 --> 00:12:09.040
However, I have my contractee, Excel.

00:12:09.540 --> 00:12:13.960
The Exceed, Stampede, is brought about by the two of us synchronizing.

00:12:17.960 --> 00:12:20.960
Why do you want to destroy the Reiseki?

00:12:20.960 --> 00:12:23.090
What are you after?

00:12:24.180 --> 00:12:26.430
Enlightenment will come in due time.

00:12:27.050 --> 00:12:30.470
Even for ignorant and foolish people such as yourselves...

00:12:30.680 --> 00:12:32.850
Are you mocking my contractee?!

00:12:33.520 --> 00:12:36.480
I regret treating you as a worthy opponent for even a brief moment.

00:12:36.770 --> 00:12:38.110
Feel free to regret it.

00:12:38.400 --> 00:12:42.860
Regret the fact that you thought you defeated me!

00:12:45.700 --> 00:12:47.620
Using that technique again?

00:12:47.620 --> 00:12:48.240
It's useless.

00:12:48.990 --> 00:12:50.870
It won't reach us!

00:13:00.460 --> 00:13:02.880
It won't breach my Hex Wall!

00:13:04.090 --> 00:13:06.760
You survived due to that last time, right?

00:13:07.340 --> 00:13:08.640
In that case!

00:13:12.310 --> 00:13:13.350
Impossible.

00:13:13.430 --> 00:13:15.440
Why does he have such a vast amount of Tera?

00:13:17.270 --> 00:13:19.810
This is my true power!

00:13:22.150 --> 00:13:23.150
Excel!

00:13:23.190 --> 00:13:24.240
This is bad!

00:13:24.240 --> 00:13:25.490
If this goes on...

00:13:55.930 --> 00:13:57.440
Steiner!

00:14:03.980 --> 00:14:05.690
A bunch of weaklings...

00:14:05.690 --> 00:14:08.860
I wanted to show Kuro-chan our awesome Exceed.

00:14:11.200 --> 00:14:11.950
Again?

00:14:13.830 --> 00:14:15.700
Don't tell me Excel-san and Steiner are...

00:14:25.670 --> 00:14:26.710
Excel-san!

00:14:27.880 --> 00:14:29.550
What horrible injuries...

00:14:30.260 --> 00:14:31.640
Did Brother cause this?

00:14:33.390 --> 00:14:35.100
Why is it his clone?

00:14:35.520 --> 00:14:36.980
Where's his actual body?

00:14:39.140 --> 00:14:40.480
Just what is going on?

00:14:40.980 --> 00:14:45.190
Most likely, when he and Reishin-sama fought,

00:14:45.980 --> 00:14:52.620
he used his clone to evacuate his contractee because he wanted to save her life at the very least.

00:14:52.870 --> 00:14:53.910
Which means...

00:14:53.910 --> 00:14:55.160
Impossible...

00:14:57.950 --> 00:14:59.410
Steiner...

00:15:00.500 --> 00:15:01.750
Don't...

00:15:02.830 --> 00:15:07.260
Don't... leave me... alone...

00:15:09.760 --> 00:15:11.180
Steiner!

00:15:15.720 --> 00:15:17.390
Steiner...

00:15:18.390 --> 00:15:19.600
Where are you...

00:15:21.390 --> 00:15:24.190
Steiner!

00:15:29.940 --> 00:15:32.240
Should I thank you?

00:15:32.910 --> 00:15:34.530
There's no need.

00:15:35.490 --> 00:15:38.200
I wasn't able to complete my mission.

00:15:39.080 --> 00:15:49.130
However, I was glad to be a Mototsumitama since I managed to fight... with you.

00:15:53.640 --> 00:15:56.930
Steiner from the German High Council.

00:15:57.310 --> 00:16:00.310
I won't forget that name.

00:16:02.440 --> 00:16:03.810
Sorry to keep you waiting.

00:16:17.200 --> 00:16:19.790
This... is the end!

00:16:35.510 --> 00:16:40.260
I guess evading that was too much for you right after a grueling battle.

00:16:40.970 --> 00:16:45.100
My instant death Exceed, Seeding Sword.

00:16:45.480 --> 00:16:47.230
You are...?

00:16:47.520 --> 00:16:49.360
He's Raiga.

00:16:49.980 --> 00:16:52.610
The Mototsumitama who formed a contract with me.

00:16:53.490 --> 00:16:55.740
Raiga, from the Kiba clan.

00:16:56.160 --> 00:16:57.490
Kuraki...

00:16:57.910 --> 00:17:00.240
You're from the Kiba clan?

00:17:00.540 --> 00:17:01.200
Yes.

00:17:01.200 --> 00:17:05.120
I'm a survivor of the clan that you exterminated from this area.

00:17:05.330 --> 00:17:09.380
I've lived till now only so that I could have my revenge against you.

00:17:10.040 --> 00:17:12.300
This is all for the sake of revenge.

00:17:17.390 --> 00:17:18.970
Kakuma-sama...

00:17:20.260 --> 00:17:24.310
Is this so that you can have revenge for the Kiba clan?

00:17:26.480 --> 00:17:29.730
I was your most devoted follower.

00:17:29.730 --> 00:17:36.360
I thought that since it's you, you would create an ideal world where humans and Mototsumitama can coexist.

00:17:36.650 --> 00:17:39.620
A traitor and someone out for revenge are cooperating?

00:17:39.620 --> 00:17:43.660
But the only things in your eyes were Mototsumitama.

00:17:44.250 --> 00:17:51.210
Destroying all the Reiseki in the world would just result in a world ruled only by the Mototsumitama.

00:17:55.010 --> 00:17:59.140
In the end, we are unable to walk down the same path!

00:18:04.100 --> 00:18:07.640
A few days ago, I got an answer from my simulations.

00:18:09.100 --> 00:18:15.650
What will happen if someone absorbs the huge amount of Tera produced from within a Reiseki when it is shattered?

00:18:16.440 --> 00:18:21.660
The vast amount of Tera produced by the Master Roots are now being sent towards this island.

00:18:22.580 --> 00:18:26.040
Even though they are only capable of reflecting the flow for a few minutes,

00:18:26.040 --> 00:18:32.630
the abnormally dense Tera in the center will be absorbed by the closest item that has the highest Tera content.

00:18:32.630 --> 00:18:34.670
The density will continue to increase.

00:18:35.420 --> 00:18:41.930
It will pierce the dimension we exist in and form a wormhole that links to another dimension.

00:18:42.470 --> 00:18:43.550
The Reiseki is...

00:18:43.550 --> 00:18:45.680
Hey, what's going on?

00:18:50.770 --> 00:18:58.110
This hole that sucks everything near it into another dimension will only close when a condition is met.

00:18:58.690 --> 00:19:02.700
Which is when the item with the highest Tera content is swallowed by the hole.

00:19:03.450 --> 00:19:05.910
And that's you, Reishin-sama!

00:19:07.410 --> 00:19:11.960
Kuraki, the world you see is nothing but one aspect of it!

00:19:12.460 --> 00:19:14.170
How disappointing.

00:19:14.170 --> 00:19:16.710
Not even a single word of regret.

00:19:19.050 --> 00:19:23.850
Your ideals won't materialize even if you defeat me!

00:19:24.720 --> 00:19:26.970
Farewell, Reishin-sama.

00:19:30.730 --> 00:19:33.690
Kakuma, the island is...

00:19:56.130 --> 00:19:56.210
This is the first frame of the ED

00:20:03.300 --> 00:20:14.400
As it thaws my frozen body, before we realize it, dawn arrives.

00:20:03.300 --> 00:20:14.400
Itsu Shika Asa wo Mukae Itetsuku Karada Tokete

00:20:14.400 --> 00:20:25.820
I've returned from my untimely death with my awakened memories.

00:20:14.400 --> 00:20:25.820
Sameta Kioku de Hayasugita Shi wo Kaeshite

00:20:26.160 --> 00:20:38.210
The sounds of the bugs weeping, the sounds of the birds dancing in flight...

00:20:26.160 --> 00:20:38.210
Mushitachi no Naku Koe mo Toritachi no Mau Haoto ni mo

00:20:38.210 --> 00:20:54.600
This soundless, white wasteland will be overflowing with their vivid colors.

00:20:38.210 --> 00:20:54.600
Oto wo Nakushita Shiroki Kare Chi ni Afureru Iro wo Sosoide Iku Azayaka ni

00:20:56.690 --> 00:21:01.070
"Intermission"

00:20:57.100 --> 00:21:01.070
Share prices for K-ON Mart have been rising the last few months.

00:21:01.360 --> 00:21:04.820
Share prices for the Kaionji Holdings, the one behind the chain, have also been ris-

00:21:05.910 --> 00:21:07.320
It'll be okay.

00:21:07.870 --> 00:21:11.580
I'll make it so that you definitely won't meet the Root.

00:21:14.500 --> 00:21:15.870
Father?

00:21:15.870 --> 00:21:17.790
Oh, it's Chairman Kaionji.

00:21:17.790 --> 00:21:20.380
I would have went to receive you if I knew that you were coming.

00:21:20.380 --> 00:21:21.210
It's okay.

00:21:21.920 --> 00:21:25.470
Kuraki-kun, I didn't want to trouble you.

00:21:26.090 --> 00:21:30.050
Our group's performance has improved all thanks to you.

00:21:30.050 --> 00:21:31.970
That's just my duty.

00:21:33.640 --> 00:21:38.940
I was wondering if you were willing to become the vice-chairman of the group.
